    {
      "text": "that the land perish not through the famine, Gen. 41:36. unto the Lord to gaze, and many of them perish, Ex. 19:21. ye shall perish among the heathen, Lev. 26:38. I testify … that ye shall surely perish, Deut. 8:19 (30:18). way of the ungodly shall perish, Ps. 1:6. They shall perish, but thou shalt endure, Ps. 102:26 (Heb. 1:11). expectation of the wicked shall perish, Prov. 10:28. he that speaketh lies shall perish, Prov. 19:9. false witness shall perish, Prov. 21:28. Where there is no vision, the people perish, Prov. 29:18. wisdom of their wise men shall perish, Isa. 29:14 (2 Ne. 27:26; D&C 76:9). they that strive with thee shall perish, Isa. 41:11. righteous perisheth, and no man layeth it to heart, Isa. 57:1. kingdom that will not serve thee shall perish, Isa. 60:12. law shall perish from the priest, Ezek. 7:26. good man is perished out of the earth, Micah 7:2.",
