    {
      "text": "It is better that one man should perish, 1 Ne. 4:13. plates of brass should never perish, 1 Ne. 5:19. ye will perish, because of the hardness of your hearts, 1 Ne. 15:10. afflicted in the flesh, and shall not be suffered to perish, 2 Ne. 6:11. come unto the Holy One of Israel, and feast upon that which perisheth not, 2 Ne. 9:51. he that fighteth against Zion shall perish, 2 Ne. 10:13. seed should never perish, 2 Ne. 25:21. would not suffer the laborer in Zion to perish, 2 Ne. 26:30. if they labor for money they shall perish, 2 Ne. 26:31. day that they are fully ripe in iniquity they shall perish, 2 Ne. 28:16. the infant perisheth not that dieth in his infancy, Mosiah 3:18. wo be unto that man, for his substance shall perish with him, Mosiah 4:23. not bear that any human soul should perish, Mosiah 28:3. there must be an atonement made, or else all mankind must unavoidably perish, Alma 34:9. whosoever perisheth, perisheth unto himself, Hel. 14:30.",
